=== Mob loot ===
In [[Normal]] and [[Hard]] difficulties, [[zombie]]s, [[husk]]s, [[skeleton]]s, [[stray]]s, and [[bogged]] have a chance to spawn with armor, with a 32.23% chance of it being copper armor. There is a 8.5% chance (9.5% with [[Looting]] I, 10.5% with Looting II and 11.5% with Looting III) for the mob to drop the armor they're wearing upon death. The dropped armor is usually badly damaged, and may be [[enchanted]] with enchantment levels 5-19.

== Usage ==
{{main|Armor#Usage}}
Wearing copper armor reduces damage taken from [[Armor#Damage types|most damage types]].

